05:14.356 --> 05:16.524
Madam Stenographer, Bailiff Clarence,

05:16.525 --> 05:18.234
Snack Cart Steve,

05:18.235 --> 05:20.152
elderly widows with paper fans,

05:20.153 --> 05:22.154
woman in the third
row with a flower hat,

05:22.155 --> 05:23.948
Deputy Fife, Boo Radley,

05:23.949 --> 05:26.325
Yay Radley, Herman Munster judge,

05:26.326 --> 05:28.619
lazy dog who wandered
in due to the heat,

05:28.620 --> 05:31.288
crazed Al Pacino, old Robert Duvall,

05:31.289 --> 05:34.250
young Robert Duvall,
in-between Robert Duvall,

05:34.251 --> 05:36.210
the books of John Grisham.

05:36.211 --> 05:38.171
The defense rests.

05:41.174 --> 05:43.050
<i>We now return to Jesse Eisenberg</i>

05:43.051 --> 05:46.095
<i>and Emma Stone in</i> Opposite Eye Sizes.

05:46.096 --> 05:47.930
Sorry, guys. All I have left

05:47.931 --> 05:49.890
are one pair of
extra-large contact lenses

05:49.891 --> 05:51.600
and one pair of extra-small.

05:51.601 --> 05:54.770
Uh, we'll be fine.

05:54.771 --> 05:57.106
Well, I just got off the phone
with the electronics store.

05:57.107 --> 06:00.484
Your stupid fight caused
$3,000 worth of damage.

06:00.485 --> 06:03.237
Well, I'm not very good at math.
Y-You lost me.

06:03.238 --> 06:05.406
- A thousand dollars.
- Wow!

06:05.407 --> 06:07.992
- Another thousand dollars.
- Oh, my goodness!

06:07.993 --> 06:09.577
A third thousand dollars.

06:09.578 --> 06:11.538
Now you lost me again.

06:11.539 --> 06:13.289
I don't think Chris can count to three.

06:13.290 --> 06:14.665
How are we gonna pay 'em back?

06:14.666 --> 06:16.125
Whoa, what do you mean, "we"?

06:16.126 --> 06:18.419
Yeah, do you expect
all nine of us to chip in?

06:18.420 --> 06:20.462
Come on, we got to think of some way

06:20.463 --> 06:21.797
to raise that money in a hurry.

06:21.798 --> 06:23.799
<i>Good afternoon, Quahog. I'm Tom Tucker.</i>

06:23.800 --> 06:27.303
<i>Actor, director
and odd-nostriled punch line</i>

06:27.304 --> 06:30.014
<i>Zach Braff has successfully
Kickstarted another movie.</i>

06:30.015 --> 06:31.348
<i>The shameless film star</i>

06:31.349 --> 06:33.559
