06:40.025 --> 06:42.693
But, Brian, people don't just
donate money on Kickstarter.

06:42.694 --> 06:45.321
It has to go toward
some sort of project.

06:45.322 --> 06:47.656
Okay,
then we'll say we're making a movie.

06:47.657 --> 06:49.408
And who will we get to direct?

06:49.409 --> 06:51.660
We'll raise the money we need,
pay back the store,

06:51.661 --> 06:53.954
and then e-mail the backers,
saying we ran into trouble

06:53.955 --> 06:55.664
and couldn't finish the project.

06:55.665 --> 06:58.042
Great idea, Brian.
Much better than that version

06:58.043 --> 07:02.171
of<i> Free Solo</i> narrated
by a concerned Midwestern mom.

07:02.172 --> 07:03.964
<i>Oh, that's too high, Alex.</i>

07:03.965 --> 07:05.799
<i>That's too high. Oh, I can't watch.</i>

07:05.800 --> 07:07.301
<i>Now, now, why wouldn't you just have</i>

07:07.302 --> 07:08.886
<i>a nice lunch at Applebee's?</i>

07:08.887 --> 07:11.556
<i>I like that bird, though.</i>

07:16.519 --> 07:18.687
Griffin, why is this floor wet?

07:18.688 --> 07:20.147
Oh, sorry, that's from me.

07:20.148 --> 07:22.066
I-I got a little perspiration problem.

07:22.067 --> 07:23.817
Hey, what time is our meeting, Oscar?

07:23.818 --> 07:25.152
It's... Aah!

07:25.153 --> 07:28.197
Sorry. What time is our meeting,
Aah-scar?

07:28.198 --> 07:30.866
Damn it, Griffin, you've become
a liability in this office.

07:30.867 --> 07:33.035
- Why? 'Cause I'm drunk and have a gun?
- No.

07:33.036 --> 07:34.578
- 'Cause of the cocaine?
- No.

07:34.579 --> 07:35.829
'Cause I use office petty cash

07:35.830 --> 07:37.539
