07:37.540 --> 07:41.335
No. But your perspiration
has become a serious problem.

07:41.336 --> 07:43.837
I'm afraid you're going
to have to work from home

07:43.838 --> 07:46.800
- until you get it under control.
- All right, if you insist.

07:46.801 --> 07:48.217
Hey, Candy, sorry I couldn't finish

07:48.218 --> 07:50.260
'cause I'm so freakin' gacked
on ski powder.

07:50.261 --> 07:52.221
I thought the gun would get me there.

07:52.222 --> 07:53.681
Anyway, here's the office cash.

07:53.682 --> 07:56.226
Careful of the wet
floor. You're pregnant.

08:02.691 --> 08:05.275
So, Dad, are you excited
for your first day

08:05.276 --> 08:07.779
- of working from home?
- Yes, but I'm<i> very</i> late.

08:09.239 --> 08:11.281
Busy dad morning goodbyes.

08:26.548 --> 08:27.923
Forgot my phone.

08:42.605 --> 08:44.815
Are you here?

08:44.816 --> 08:47.609
So, Mom, you're okay
with Dad working in the house

08:47.610 --> 08:49.069
- all the time?
- Oh, yeah,

08:49.070 --> 08:50.988
it's nice having a coworker.

08:50.989 --> 08:53.615
'Cause being a housewife
is a full-time job.

08:53.616 --> 08:56.118
For some pretty tough bosses!

09:00.749 --> 09:03.333
Hi. So, is this your break time?

09:03.334 --> 09:04.960
