- Oh, okay.

09:04.961 --> 09:07.463
I was wondering
if my watch was off, maybe.

09:07.464 --> 09:09.089
- It's not.
- You see, Mom,

09:09.090 --> 09:11.675
we try to stay focused
on the task at hand

09:11.676 --> 09:14.595
here at Griffin, Griffin,
Griffin, Griffin and Griffin.

09:14.596 --> 09:16.472
Good morning.

09:16.473 --> 09:18.432
Griffin, Griffin, Griffin and Griffin.

09:18.433 --> 09:21.769
Huh. I thought our letterhead
had<i> five</i> Griffins on it, Meg.

09:21.770 --> 09:24.313
But you were right
to leave one of them off,

09:24.314 --> 09:26.565
because you're (BLEEP) fired.

09:32.197 --> 09:34.114
<i>Uh, hello?</i>

09:34.115 --> 09:35.824
Hey, Lois. I'm at the small bodega

09:35.825 --> 09:37.326
in the living room lobby

09:37.327 --> 09:39.244
trying to pick out
a new baby card for Janine.

09:39.245 --> 09:40.788
Wai... Who's Janine?

09:40.789 --> 09:42.873
Yeah, right? Anyway, should I get one

09:42.874 --> 09:44.792
with a baby with
SpaghettiOs on his head,

09:44.793 --> 09:47.002
